{"arguments":{"doc":"d1"},"at":24,"case":"transcripts/w10-board-pack#1","event":"call","outputs":[],"result":{"app":{},"changed":[],"checks":{},"created":[],"data":"<!-- p:5FCB534E -->\n# Board pack, Q3 2026\n\n<!-- p:4C32E1FB -->\nPrepared for the board meeting of 21 October 2026. Each department's highlights follow under its own heading.\n\n<!-- p:16425160 -->\n# Finance\n\n<!-- p:69E36C9F -->\n## Highlights\n\n<!-- p:058B17C9 -->\nRevenue for the quarter was EUR 48.2 million, 3% above budget.\n\n<!-- p:6A70E1A8 -->\nOperating costs held flat; the energy hedge saved EUR 0.6 million.\n\n<!-- p:73D22116 -->\nCash conversion improved to 91% after the new invoicing run.\n\n<!-- p:3B212964 -->\n# Operations\n\n<!-- p:7C9523C2 -->\n## Highlights\n\n<!-- p:599FE6A2 -->\nOn-time delivery reached 96.4%, the best quarter this year.\n\n<!-- p:20FFCF19 -->\nThe Rotterdam hub absorbed two new retail customers without overtime.\n\n<!-- p:3EB3FF6C -->\nTwo forklift incidents were reported; neither caused injury.\n\n<!-- p:12972045 -->\n# People\n\n<!-- p:767E7C15 -->\n## Highlights\n\n<!-- p:2F9E5978 -->\nHeadcount rose by 14 to 612, mostly in the Rotterdam hub.\n\n<!-- p:654112D5 -->\nVoluntary turnover fell to 7.8% on a twelve-month basis.\n\n<!-- p:31B189E1 -->\nThe leadership programme's first cohort of 18 graduated in September.\n\n<!-- p:4B50F4CD -->\n# Sales\n\n<!-- p:4329EC82 -->\n## Highlights\n\n<!-- p:439BA4A8 -->\nBookings were EUR 52.0 million, with a book-to-bill ratio of 1.08.\n\n<!-- p:70439822 -->\nTwo framework agreements were renewed for three years.\n\n<!-- p:11698B22 -->\nThe pipeline for the fourth quarter stands at EUR 140 million.\n\n<!-- p:77B9C794 -->\n# IT\n\n<!-- p:05252BEE -->\n## Highlights\n\n<!-- p:3052721F -->\nThe warehouse system upgrade went live on 14 August without downtime.\n\n<!-- p:43450195 -->\nPhishing simulations showed a click rate of 3.1%, down from 5.4%.\n\n<!-- p:78481EA1 -->\nThe data centre exit is on track for the end of the first quarter.\n","doc":"d1","next_cursor":null,"ok":true,"removed":[],"renamed":{},"summary":"Read the document (final)","total":1768,"version":6,"warnings":[]},"tool":"word_read"}
